meta {
  name: Get My Year Content
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/user/my_year
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get My Year Content

  This request is used to get list of year in which the user has created content (Vehicle, Trip, Service, and Wash History). This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — User year fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `year`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "user year fetched",
    "data": [
      { "year": 2024 }
    ]
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — user year failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "user year not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}